    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/df/Unchou_Kanu_Seito_Warlord_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251018002611\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Unchou Kanu Seito Warlord Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/df/Unchou_Kanu_Seito_Warlord_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251018002611\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"586\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Unchou Kanu Seito Warlord Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Unchou_Kanu_Seito_Warlord_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\"\u003eAppearance\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnchou_Kanu%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKan-u is a tall and big-breasted tan-skinned young woman with dark-purple hair that goes all the way down to her feet where the end is being tied together with bangs covering her left eye while she has chest-length hair strands hanging on either side and light blue-grey eyes.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe is usually seen wearing the Seito academy uniform, comprising of a revealing white sailor uniform\u0027s blouse with blue stripes and a yellow ribbon, a matching blue skirt, loose white socks, and brown shoes.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\"\u003ePersonality\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnchou_Kanu%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKan-u is shown to be a very loyal person. This is shown when she allowed herself to be captured by the enemy in order to protect her leader. Kan-u also seems to be very lenient with Gentoku Ryuubi, allowing her to do as she pleases as long as she or Ekitoku Chouhi is with her.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKan-u is also very proud of her skills, and name, as shown when she had continuously and tirelessly trained to no end, not only to protect Gentoku, but also prove to everyone that she is worthy of the name: Unchou Kan-u.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:74px; top:0.5px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (244 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:74px;\"\u003e\u003cnoscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/53/Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20251018002840\" title=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen\u0026#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (244 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen\u0026#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"\u003e\u003c/noscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (244 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.j